  "limitations": [
    "Independent runs from public spawns, with an explicitly known objective and no opponents.",
    "A horizontal point moves over public 1 m floor samples and cover outlines. Native collision, player radius and inertia are omitted. Yaw response, speed, jump height and airtime are calibrated from the 17eb own-seat trace.",
    "Default step limit is 0.48 m. The sensitivity run uses a 0.16 m limit within 2 m of three recorded stalls on Mirage, bracketing observed ~0.20 m risers.",
    "The optional Mirage B check accepts a step rejected by the coarse terrain only within 0.35 m horizontally and vertically of a same-direction grounded segment from the independent trace; observations remain private to the evaluator.",
    "Stalled seconds are callbacks that travel under 20% of requested motion. Completion requires continuous use inside the public plant zone or within 2.8 m of the bomb for the game duration. Travel times and outcomes apply only to this exercise."
